    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join the pharmacy team!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/403ce11bbd5badaa21eb3627ea2034a7.poster.avif?t=1748914031\" width=608 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/403ce11bbd5badaa21eb3627ea2034a7.webm?t=1748914031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/403ce11bbd5badaa21eb3627ea2034a7.mp4?t=1748914031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/ccbbf0d363afa33f061ead74c24a9d1e.poster.avif?t=1748914031\" width=608 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/ccbbf0d363afa33f061ead74c24a9d1e.webm?t=1748914031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/ccbbf0d363afa33f061ead74c24a9d1e.mp4?t=1748914031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/d7cb645e0e5a32a13b7eafbef715a569.poster.avif?t=1748914031\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/d7cb645e0e5a32a13b7eafbef715a569.webm?t=1748914031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/d7cb645e0e5a32a13b7eafbef715a569.mp4?t=1748914031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pharmacy Management Simulator is a shop simulation developed by a pharmacist where you build your own pharmacy business from the ground up. Sell medication and administer vaccines to earn money actively or set up passive income streams within your shop with medical scales and blood pressure machines. Use your income to expand your pharmacy and grow your business!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/913b6b12d303b96cafb47bbf09f10987.webp?t=1748914031\" width=609 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/7c6f52e173ddd426e50e84bc4ee02e35.poster.avif?t=1748914031\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/7c6f52e173ddd426e50e84bc4ee02e35.webm?t=1748914031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/7c6f52e173ddd426e50e84bc4ee02e35.mp4?t=1748914031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be accurate when administering vaccines or your pharmacy's reputation could be effected. With experience, it may become easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/913b6b12d303b96cafb47bbf09f10987.webp?t=1748914031\" width=609 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/395b4f1ef67da70b26258672ce098276.poster.avif?t=1748914031\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/395b4f1ef67da70b26258672ce098276.webm?t=1748914031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/395b4f1ef67da70b26258672ce098276.mp4?t=1748914031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep customer wait times short by filling prescriptions in a timely fashion. Customer's don't like waiting very long so manage your time wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/913b6b12d303b96cafb47bbf09f10987.webp?t=1748914031\" width=609 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/146538757c7c6865e966dceccef07fe3.poster.avif?t=1748914031\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/146538757c7c6865e966dceccef07fe3.webm?t=1748914031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/146538757c7c6865e966dceccef07fe3.mp4?t=1748914031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and customize your pharmacy. Optimize your layout, organize and stock your shelves to improve your customers' shopping experience and maximize profits.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/913b6b12d303b96cafb47bbf09f10987.webp?t=1748914031\" width=609 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/6fb2d6766e037fb467ce48d472b4e282.poster.avif?t=1748914031\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/6fb2d6766e037fb467ce48d472b4e282.webm?t=1748914031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/6fb2d6766e037fb467ce48d472b4e282.mp4?t=1748914031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes customers get impatient. Maintain your pharmacy's reputation by helping them 'cool' off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/913b6b12d303b96cafb47bbf09f10987.webp?t=1748914031\" width=609 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/ff0e7684cb520abc0b1410952eefca7c.poster.avif?t=1748914031\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/ff0e7684cb520abc0b1410952eefca7c.webm?t=1748914031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/ff0e7684cb520abc0b1410952eefca7c.mp4?t=1748914031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your pharmacy to have space for more inventory and attract additional customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/913b6b12d303b96cafb47bbf09f10987.webp?t=1748914031\" width=609 height=60 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>About the Developer</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey everyone, thank you for checking out my game! I'm Cole, the solo-developer of Pharmacy Management Simulator. I'm a pharmacist and wanted to make a game that gives players a glimpse into what it is like to be one. The shop simulation genre felt like a good fit for this and happens to be one I thoroughly enjoy myself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I would love to connect with you so feel free to reach out via the platform of your choice. I hope that you join the pharmacy team and enjoy the game. Cheers :)</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/d7cb645e0e5a32a13b7eafbef715a569.poster.avif?t=1748914031\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/d7cb645e0e5a32a13b7eafbef715a569.webm?t=1748914031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/d7cb645e0e5a32a13b7eafbef715a569.mp4?t=1748914031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pharmacy Management Simulator is a shop simulation developed by a pharmacist where you build your own pharmacy business from the ground up. Sell medication and administer vaccines to earn money actively or set up passive income streams within your shop with medical scales and blood pressure machines. Use your income to expand your pharmacy and grow your business!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/913b6b12d303b96cafb47bbf09f10987.webp?t=1748914031\" width=609 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/7c6f52e173ddd426e50e84bc4ee02e35.poster.avif?t=1748914031\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/7c6f52e173ddd426e50e84bc4ee02e35.webm?t=1748914031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/7c6f52e173ddd426e50e84bc4ee02e35.mp4?t=1748914031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be accurate when administering vaccines or your pharmacy's reputation could be effected. With experience, it may become easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/913b6b12d303b96cafb47bbf09f10987.webp?t=1748914031\" width=609 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/395b4f1ef67da70b26258672ce098276.poster.avif?t=1748914031\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/395b4f1ef67da70b26258672ce098276.webm?t=1748914031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/395b4f1ef67da70b26258672ce098276.mp4?t=1748914031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep customer wait times short by filling prescriptions in a timely fashion. Customer's don't like waiting very long so manage your time wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/913b6b12d303b96cafb47bbf09f10987.webp?t=1748914031\" width=609 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/146538757c7c6865e966dceccef07fe3.poster.avif?t=1748914031\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/146538757c7c6865e966dceccef07fe3.webm?t=1748914031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/146538757c7c6865e966dceccef07fe3.mp4?t=1748914031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and customize your pharmacy. Optimize your layout, organize and stock your shelves to improve your customers' shopping experience and maximize profits.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/913b6b12d303b96cafb47bbf09f10987.webp?t=1748914031\" width=609 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/6fb2d6766e037fb467ce48d472b4e282.poster.avif?t=1748914031\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/6fb2d6766e037fb467ce48d472b4e282.webm?t=1748914031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/6fb2d6766e037fb467ce48d472b4e282.mp4?t=1748914031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes customers get impatient. Maintain your pharmacy's reputation by helping them 'cool' off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/913b6b12d303b96cafb47bbf09f10987.webp?t=1748914031\" width=609 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/ff0e7684cb520abc0b1410952eefca7c.poster.avif?t=1748914031\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/ff0e7684cb520abc0b1410952eefca7c.webm?t=1748914031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/ff0e7684cb520abc0b1410952eefca7c.mp4?t=1748914031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your pharmacy to have space for more inventory and attract additional customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509550/extras/913b6b12d303b96cafb47bbf09f10987.webp?t=1748914031\" width=609 height=60 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>About the Developer</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey everyone, thank you for checking out my game! I'm Cole, the solo-developer of Pharmacy Management Simulator. I'm a pharmacist and wanted to make a game that gives players a glimpse into what it is like to be one. The shop simulation genre felt like a good fit for this and happens to be one I thoroughly enjoy myself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I would love to connect with you so feel free to reach out via the platform of your choice. I hope that you join the pharmacy team and enjoy the game. Cheers :)</p>",
